tag_reorganization.user_template:
Analyze these {total_tags} tags and create a hierarchical reorganization.

CURRENT TAGS DATA:
{tags_json}

STATISTICS:
- Total tags: {total_tags}
- Total tag applications: {total_taggings}
- Average usage per tag: {average_usage}

Create a JSON response with this EXACT structure:
{{
  "hierarchy": {{
    "tag_name": {{
      "display_name": "Display Name",
      "description": "Description of this category",
      "level": 0,
      "parent": null,
      "children": ["child1", "child2"],
      "synonyms": ["synonym1", "synonym2"],
      "icon": "📁"
    }}
  }},
  "root_categories": ["category1", "category2"],
  "deprecated_tags": ["old_tag1", "old_tag2"],
  "merge_proposals": [
    {{
      "primary": "main_tag",
      "merge_into": ["duplicate1", "duplicate2"],
      "reason": "These tags represent the same concept"
    }}
  ],
  "new_categories_suggested": [
    {{
      "name": "new_category",
      "display_name": "New Category",
      "description": "Why this category is needed"
    }}
  ],
  "confidence_score": 0.85,
  "reasoning": "Explanation of the reorganization logic..."
}}

IMPORTANT:
- Create 5-10 root categories
- Group related tags logically
- Identify and merge duplicates
- Suggest new categories where needed
- All tags must appear in the hierarchy
